      "contents": "<div class=\"se-viewer se-theme-default\" lang=\"ko-KR\">\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_START -->\n    <!--@CONTENTS_HEADER-->\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_END -->\n    <div class=\"se-main-container\">\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-f3ed0e3e-c367-4999-bb84-8683787e6daa\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-936e9846-1cc0-4288-85ff-66bd2e10a3da\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-7835dc23-6c61-4032-b24c-2ad4928ca84e\"><b> 【스텔라 블레이드 콜라보 스토리 이벤트 MEMORIES TELLER 예고】</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5f612db3-9016-4c73-987d-10d040e61561\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-102f44b5-eecd-415f-a36f-a6a1f2e15405\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a71c3e67-b5a5-487d-bffa-45a979d5a0db\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b57cc4c7-75e7-4fa6-aaa7-72f6890221b5\">풀 보이스 더빙을 포함한 콜라보 스토리 이벤트가</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c134a572-5764-45c1-b5d7-c4f658b931e3\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-482705af-8b6d-45e0-853b-604b7f1217c0\">6월 12일(목) 업데이트 됩니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-dc9cc08b-3e99-4443-ad00-c7e441956cf9\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-ffd9d5d7-1c97-4b7a-aee5-720bd953b865\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a6ce2b1f-8cf5-412c-83fb-ece8f176c924\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b7e9c48e-6d8c-4c15-8ab1-f77ba6183775\">언제나와 다름없던 날, 고철 수집 로봇 롬에게서 연락이 온다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-23faac78-a4b8-4a14-a79c-3b43ddde342c\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-085563ce-a7ca-4778-995c-885bc74ff9fa\">내용은 지상에서 인간을 발견했다는 것.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8d418352-c999-4ab1-aa12-1daf4dcc0d8b\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-32cfaca6-b3f1-4bbd-a3b0-39eee932bc16\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-68b6d09a-e08b-46aa-8da0-7c81edc6cea7\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-7d90d79f-930f-418c-b396-27e55d1cd79f\">지상에 남은 인간의 수는 공식적으로 0명.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-421be0b5-fad5-4bd0-9abf-496e63b97490\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-2b2873bd-81fe-41de-873f-09b9c826e5f5\">카운터스는 서둘러 롬이 알려준 장소로 향하고,</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9f3b10f7-d0e6-4669-888f-4c4ff0bb7bfa\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-85f3b26b-0e7c-44c5-b19c-9e3c8ae1bdbd\">그곳에서 새로운 인물들을 만나게 된다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d8a2660f-da2d-4592-82d7-5b42315587d7\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b7e3ed93-6bd9-45e4-a228-00afde71cdbb\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d26a055e-7435-4424-86b5-bc71f55dbba2\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-02068f24-ddef-4ff8-a69b-73e0812653fa\">​* 인앱 구매(확률형 아이템 포함)</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-dd134c88-ad44-46a3-b5f7-1da290afb9fa\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-118f6269-20b5-4697-8dee-c325601f79f4\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module-v2='{\"type\": \"v2_text\", \"id\": \"SE-f3ed0e3e-c367-4999-bb84-8683787e6daa\", \"data\": {\"ctype\": \"text\"  }}'></script>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-6568b779-b735-4dc6-89e6-8b1278d1ec01\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-fit\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" >\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-6568b779-b735-4dc6-89e6-8b1278d1ec01\", \"src\" : \"https://nng-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNTA2MDdfMTg0/MDAxNzQ5Mjg0MjI5ODEw.PD4W5oUGRcdTEBE0Ixg_DQh_B0u5ArQ2uxLhBk787fwg.dtTNjJ5tq5drBuJMn8tQqN9YFQ14NUC2j5P0VItqUrwg.JPEG/2._NK%EC%8A%A4%ED%85%94%EB%9D%BC_%EB%B8%94%EB%A0%88%EC%9D%B4%EB%93%9C_%EC%BD%9C%EB%9D%BC%EB%B3%B4_%EB%B9%8C%EB%9